Applied Finite Mathematics: XYZ Homework edition
================================================

This repository is an adaptation, maintained by XYZ Homework, of "Applied Finite
Mathematics" by Rupinder Sekhon (De Anza College), originally published on OpenStax CNX
(cnx.org, collection col10613) under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 license
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Changes were made.

The edition as a whole is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/); the full
text is in LICENSE. The original CC BY 3.0 material remains available under its original
license from its source.

